      "statement": "Meta (buyer): in its 51.2T CPO evaluation the ELS module drove most CPO failures (root-caused to a laser-drive SMT component, fixed by design change); its next 102.4T design keeps field-replaceable ELSFP laser modules and requires OIF ELSFP compliance to enable an open ecosystem and multi-sourcing. Reliability is implementation- and vendor-specific. No ELS vendor is named.",
